    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d497">

                <pb facs="0745" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg671"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Motley.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 194.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-07-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 2, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I acknowledge with many thanks your
                    interesting despatch of June 13, No. 187, in which the posture of affairs
                    between Austria and Prussia at that date is concisely and clearly described. I
                    shall await with much interest your account of subsequent important events which
                    may have taken place.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>J. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lothrop Motley</hi>, Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
